hadiths[5]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1102","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) se riwayat hai, Aap ne farmaya: Jo logon key maal ley unhey ada karney ka iraada rakhta ho to Allah uski taraf se ada karega. Aur jo unhey zaaya karney ka iraada rakhta ho to Allah use zaaya karega. (Bukhari: 2387)"
"1103","[AI-translation] Abu Zarr (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key sath tha. Phir jab Aap ne Uhad ko dekha to farmaya: Mujhey pasand nahi hai ke wo merey liye sona ban jaey aur merey paas us mein se deenaar teen se zyada thehrey, magar deenaar jo main qarz key liye rakkhun. Phir farmaya: Beshak zyada waley kam waley hain magar jo maal se aisa aisa kehta hai. Aur wo bahut kam hain. Aur farmaya: Apni jagah (raho). Aur thodi door aagey badhey. To main ne aawaaz suni aur main ne chaaha ke main Aap key paas aaun. Phir mujhey Aap ka qaul (apni jagah yahan tak ke main tumharey paas aaun) yaad aaya. Phir jab Aap aey to main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Jo main ne suna ya farmaya: Jo aawaaz main ne suni? Aap ne farmaya: Aur kya tum ne suni? Main ne kaha: Haan. Aap ne farmaya: Merey paas Jibreel (Alaihissalam) aey aur unhon-ne kaha: Jo tumhaari ummat mein se mara jabke wo Allah key sath kisi cheez ko shareek na karta tha wo Jannat mein daakhil hoga. Main ne kaha: Agarchey us ne aisa aisa kya? Unhon-ne kaha: Haan. (Bukhari: 2388)"
"1104","[AI-translation] Jaabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) key paas aaya jabke Aap masjid mein Chaasht key waqt they. To Aap ne farmaya: Do rakatein padho. Aur mera Aap par qarz tha. To Aap ne mujhey ada kya aur zyada diya. (Bukhari: 2394)"
"1105","[AI-translation] Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Koi momin nahi magar main duniya aur aakhirat mein uska zyada haqdaar hun. Padho agar chaaaho: (Nabi mominon key apni jaanon se zyada haqdaar hain). Phir jo momin mara aur maal chhor gaya to uskey qareebi rishtedaar waaris honge jo hon. Aur jo qarz ya beyaar-o-madadgaar chhor gaya to merey paas aaey, main uska sarparast hun. (Bukhari: 2399). Abu Hurairah (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, wo kehtey hain: Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya ya farmaya: Main ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ko farmatey huey suna: Jo apna maal uski aankh key sath aadmi ya insaan key paas paaey jo deewaaliya ho gaya ho to wo uska uskey siwa zyada haqdaar hai. (2402). Ye hadees Ziya-ud-Daaghistani key zawaed mein se hai aur Zabidi key asl mein se nahi hai."
"1106","[AI-translation] Mugheera bin Shoaba (Raziallahu anhu) se riwayat hai, unhon-ne kaha: Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w aalehi wasallam) ne farmaya: Beshak Allah ne tum par maaaon ki naafarmaani aur betiyon ko zinda dafan karna aur rokna aur maangna haraam kya hai. Aur tumhaarey liye kaha suna aur bahut sawaal karna aur maal zaaya karna naapasand kya hai. (Bukhari: 2408). Jhagdon ki kitaab."
